{
  "about": "Quality regression gate (python -m pii_guard.eval.gate, make gate; CI job eval-gate). Each suite is scored now, rules only and offline, and compared with the newest committed run record of the same system on the same fixture files: leak and over-masking must not rise, round trip must not fall, beyond the tolerance (absolute rate, 0-1). The limits hold even when no record matches (fixtures changed). Lower a limit or a tolerance when quality improves; never raise one to make a PR pass without saying why in the PR.",
